{"id":"bnvqkrd9ngq8mc4qmhqs4ot1g","title":"天然产物空间与人工合成可达空间：分子科学的两个疆域","originalTitle":null,"summary":"分子科学探索自然界能造出什么（天然产物空间）和人类能造出什么（人工合成可达空间）。天然产物空间复杂且功能优化，受限于生物机制；人工合成可达空间则超越自然选择，以功能为导向，受限于工具与认知。两个空间通过人工合成可达空间扩展天然产物边界，共同构成化学学科的迷人图景。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3380716&do=blog&id=1561159"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T04:54:33.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T09:38:25.162Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T09:38:25.162Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表"],"score":21,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"42c0a5dc-d2ec-4041-8dc1-ab9a701109a0","title":"天然产物与人工合成空间的边界扩展及协同效应"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"42c0a5dc-d2ec-4041-8dc1-ab9a701109a0","title":"天然产物与人工合成空间的边界扩展及协同效应"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fZRapqQEgtII","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}